  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>The function <math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mtext>&#8201;&#8201;</mtext><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>&#8734;</mi><mo>,</mo><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mi>&#8734;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is not injective as <math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> but <math><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8800;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math> .<br />The function <math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mtext>&#8201;&#8201;</mtext><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>&#8734;</mi><mo>,</mo><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> is not injective&nbsp;as <math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> but <math><mn>4</mn><mo>&#8800;</mo><mn>5</mn></math><br />The function <math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mtext>&#8201;&#8201;</mtext><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mtext>&#8201;&#8201;</mtext><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>&#8734;</mi><mo>,</mo><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mi>&#8734;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is&nbsp;not injective&nbsp;as <math xmlns=